{"id":142295201,"slug":"an-open-letter-to-ransomware-hackers","title":"An Open Letter To Ransomware Hackers Attempting to Extort United Healthcare","subtitle":"It won't be easy","post_date":"2024-03-04T20:52:32.825Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/an-open-letter-to-ransomware-hackers","wordcount":552,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:54:12.239Z","body_sha256":"93e09989cc63b2d54e63ad0b07231c8e21d4f33e8f9b621a4995945bf53c2958","text_words":551,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>Dear Cybercriminals,</p><p>I understand your ransomware schemes have brought in, globally, around 1.1 billion dollars…</p><p>By the way, thank you for reading<strong> The Frontier Psychiatrists.</strong>  This is a satire/real health-themed publication. Try to keep up.  Yes, that is a lot of money to me.  It is a lot of money for most people. Here is the thing about the UnitedHealth Group….they make more money the longer this goes on, not less.  If you’d like to know how I’m covering the story, you can <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/an-imagined-town-hall-with-blackcat?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">read this article.</a>  Or this <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/i-finally-went-viral-on-tiktok?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">one. </a> Or this <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/change-healthcare-is-a-big-enough?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">one.</a></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!P_eZ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F640d5784-4060-4f6d-8cd0-46e773ccc10c_1556x577.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source 